+(?&name)	recursive call to named group NOT SUPPORTED
+(?P=name)	named backreference NOT SUPPORTED
+(?P>name)	recursive call to named group NOT SUPPORTED
+(?(cond)true|false)	conditional branch NOT SUPPORTED
