+RELEASE 0.96.90 - Tue, 15 Feb 2005 21:21:12 +0000
+
+  NOTE:  This was a pre-release of 0.97 for testing purposes.
+
+  From Anonymous:
+
+  - Fix Java parsing to avoid erroneously identifying a new array
